# Copy to .env (gitignored). Never commit real values.
# The CFBD API key is NOT configured here: it lives only in the Exasol CONNECTION CFBD_API (created with plain SQL, see docs/user-guide.md).
# The deployment runs as sys; its password is read at run time from
# ~/.exasol/personal/deployments/<deployment>/secrets.json and never copied anywhere.
#
# Which deployment the make targets talk to is chosen per command, not here:
#   make deploy                (local, the default)
#   make deploy TARGET=aws     (the "default" deployment; host, port and certificate fingerprint come from its files)
#
# Optional override of host and port of the selected target. Leave it unset to use the deployment's own files.
# For TARGET=aws an override must carry the pinned fingerprint: host/FINGERPRINT:8563
# EXASOL_DSN=127.0.0.1:8563
